{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"c51f199290b9109d","name":"card_unit_fiat_g55","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Italy/units/card_unit_fiat_g55","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"FIAT G.55","text":"Deployment: +2+2 if your HQ has 5 or more defense than the enemy HQ.","flavorText":"The Fiat G.55 Centauro (e. centaur) was an Italian fighter aircraft used by the Italian Royal Airforce during WWII. The Centauro entered service in 1943 and was retired only two years later, but in this short period it proved to be Italy's best fighter aircraft of the era. During its short service time it proved to be an excellent interceptor at high altitude and it performed very well against modern Allied fighters in combat. It is claimed that the German Luftwaffe considered the Fiat G.55 to be the best Axis fighter after doing comparative testing with the Messerschmitt Bf 109G and the Focke-Wulf 190. Even so, only 300 aircraft had been built by the end of WWII.","faction":"Italy","type":"fighter","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":4,"operationCost":2,"attack":4,"defense":4},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_fiat_g55","title":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_unit_fiat_g55_title","SourceString":"FIAT G.55","LocalizedString":"FIAT G.55"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::fighter","attack":4,"defense":4,"range":2,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Italy","kredits":4,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_unit_fiat_g55_text","SourceString":"Deployment: +2+2 if your HQ has 5 or more defense than the enemy HQ.","LocalizedString":"Deployment: +2+2 if your HQ has 5 or more defense than the enemy HQ."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_unit_fiat_g55_history","SourceString":"The Fiat G.55 Centauro (e. centaur) was an Italian fighter aircraft used by the Italian Royal Airforce during WWII. The Centauro entered service in 1943 and was retired only two years later, but in this short period it proved to be Italy's best fighter aircraft of the era. During its 